{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hero Slayers</strong> is a <strong>roguelite turn-based strategy RPG</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You must shape the fate of <strong>Lucy</strong>, who finds herself trapped in a crisis from which there's no easy escape due to a single misstep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even if you fail, make different choices next time\u2014so that you may reach a better ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Recruit Allies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start by recruiting companions who will assist Lucy on her expedition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609100/extras/HS_Companion.png?t=1746052305\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Strengthen Heroes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enhance your allies' <strong>skills and armor</strong> to prepare for the challenges ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609100/extras/HS_Hero.png?t=1746052305\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Equip Gear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip powerful items found during your adventures to become even stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609100/extras/HS_Equipment.png?t=1746052305\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Time Loop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t worry if your journey ends in failure.<br>Until your goal is achieved, <strong>time will rewind</strong>\u2014a curse from the gods brings you back to the start.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3609100?t=1746052305","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3609100?t=1746052305","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/